sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  box rgb(241,245,249)
    actor U as Alice, Bob
  end
  box rgb(219,234,254)
    participant A as Chain A
  end
  box rgb(237,233,254)
    participant E as Ethereum
  end
  box rgb(220,252,231)
    participant B as Chain B
  end
  box rgb(254,243,199)
    participant X as Executor
  end
  Note over U: agree on legs<br/>and a deadline
  U->>A: Alice sends<br/>leg 1 on chain A
  U->>B: Bob sends leg 2 on chain B
  rect rgb(254,226,226)
    Note over A,B: both legs must settle<br/>by the deadline (Ethereum time)
    A->>E: settle batch<br/>with leg 1
    B->>E: settle batch<br/>with leg 2
  end
  E->>A: import the<br/>interop root
  E->>B: import the<br/>interop root
  X->>B: execute leg 1<br/>(proves both legs)
  X->>A: execute leg 2<br/>(proves both legs)
  Note over A,B: Bob receives on chain B, Alice on chain A.<br/>Execution has no deadline.
